Hello Sofia, I am sending you a voice message today.
It is already Sunday evening.
I woke up very early this morning.
At first I stayed in bed.
But then I saw the light.
The sun came right into my room!
Of course I got up immediately.
I am not staying in the flat in this weather, I thought.
I am leaving the city today.
So I simply set off.
I went to Potsdam for a day.
Potsdam is located very close to Berlin.
The trip lasted all day.
I experienced a great deal.
I will tell you everything from the beginning now.
